{'symbol': 'DXCM', 'date': '2022-12-08 08:45:00', 'title': 'DEXCOM G7 RECEIVES FDA CLEARANCE: THE MOST ACCURATE CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING SYSTEM CLEARED IN THE U.S.', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--DEXCOM, INC. (NASDAQ:DXCM), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN REAL-TIME CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING FOR PEOPLE WITH DIABETES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE FDA HAS CLEARED THE NEXT-GENERATION DEXCOM G7 CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING (CGM) SYSTEM FOR PEOPLE WITH ALL TYPES OF DIABETES AGES TWO YEARS AND OLDER.'}